.TH ISHTARIA-ADMIN 1 "2026" "ishtaria-admin" "Ishtaria"
.SH NAME
ishtaria-admin \- text-mode administration of an Ishtaria world server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ishtaria-admin
[\fB\-\-database\-url=\fIURL\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turbo Vision interface for the server operator: save, load, rename, delete and
export world maps; rename, ban and delete players; manage portals to linked
worlds; schedule a server shutdown with a notice shown to players.
.PP
It talks directly to the PostgreSQL database of ishtaria-server. Run it as the
service user: \fBsudo -u ishtaria ishtaria-admin\fR. Started as root without an explicit URL it switches to that user itself.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DATABASE_URL
Connection string. Default: postgresql:///ishtaria?host=/var/run/postgresql
